Copyright 2026 Kunal Raha

This repository is a fork of Graphify (https://github.com/Graphify-Labs/graphify),
extended with the IntentGraph subsystems: persistent memory archive, associative
memory graph, hybrid and adaptive retrieval, evidence verification, context
packets, MCP agent tools, and the Nebius/NVIDIA/Tavily provider integrations.
The Graphify code is unmodified in function and remains under the Apache
License, Version 2.0; IntentGraph additions are under the same license.
